# Goal: side length of the square [m]. A value <= 0 uses the server default.
float64 side_length
---
# Result
bool success
int32 sides_completed
string message
---
# Feedback
int32 current_side          # 1..4
TargetPose current_target   # corner the turtle is driving to
float64 remaining_distance  # [m] forwarded from goToPose feedback
